    "detailed_description": "<i>Arcane Wilds</i> offers a new perspective on the RTS genre, blending Wild West fantasy with survival gameplay. Harvested resources remain localized at their gathering sites, requiring strategic transportation for use, and opening tactical opportunities to steal from enemies. Navigate procedurally generated maps, face mystical creatures, and cooperate with friends to thrive in this innovative twist on resource management and survival adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.poster.avif?t=1733505474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.webm?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.mp4?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/17a2d95b2958271a371873bb87b19191.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Innovative Resource Management: Gather, steal, and transport resources strategically.<br></li><li> Cooperative Survival Mode: Team up to overcome perilous challenges, survive against mystical creatures and tailor your own home island to your liking.<br></li><li> Wild West Fantasy Setting: Immerse yourself in a captivating blend of western and fantasy elements.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/86c910b4b08790c0fb061624a99124cc.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Harvest, steal, and transport resources strategically to fuel your faction's growth and enhance your capabilities on the battlefield.<br></li><li> Manage scarce resources wisely, balancing their allocation between base building, troop recruitment, usage of special abilities, and technological advancements.<br></li><li> Engage in strategic decision-making, including raiding enemies' stockpiles and defeating mighty creatures to secure valuable relics and additional resources.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.poster.avif?t=1733505474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.webm?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.mp4?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/1d3b055411d097449968d063ab45f680.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Survive and complete missions on procedurally generated maps in unique biomes.<br></li><li> Earn fame and return looted treasures to build, upgrade and customize your own home island.<br></li><li> Play solo or with up to three friends and choose your own adventure, difficulty and mission complexity.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/2f7034d515c8457f9816c4d928a2ffbc.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br>Arcane Wilds offers a unique blend of fantasy and western themes across its factions:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Army: Boasting a powerful arsenal, the Army faction excels in ranged combat with essence-powered cannons, compensating for their low mobility with exceptional firepower.<br></li><li> Colony: Comprising a motley crew of gunslingers, the Colony faction employs explosive barrels and rapid-firing gatling guns, creating a versatile force on the battlefield.<br></li><li> Tribe: Known for their agility and adaptability, the Tribe faction utilizes movable structures and chaos-inducing abilities from medicine men and shamans to wreak havoc among enemies.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Arcane Wilds</i> offers a new perspective on the RTS genre, blending Wild West fantasy with survival gameplay. Harvested resources remain localized at their gathering sites, requiring strategic transportation for use, and opening tactical opportunities to steal from enemies. Navigate procedurally generated maps, face mystical creatures, and cooperate with friends to thrive in this innovative twist on resource management and survival adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.poster.avif?t=1733505474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.webm?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/36fd985e37986b4110394595ada542c9.mp4?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/17a2d95b2958271a371873bb87b19191.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Innovative Resource Management: Gather, steal, and transport resources strategically.<br></li><li> Cooperative Survival Mode: Team up to overcome perilous challenges, survive against mystical creatures and tailor your own home island to your liking.<br></li><li> Wild West Fantasy Setting: Immerse yourself in a captivating blend of western and fantasy elements.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/86c910b4b08790c0fb061624a99124cc.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Harvest, steal, and transport resources strategically to fuel your faction's growth and enhance your capabilities on the battlefield.<br></li><li> Manage scarce resources wisely, balancing their allocation between base building, troop recruitment, usage of special abilities, and technological advancements.<br></li><li> Engage in strategic decision-making, including raiding enemies' stockpiles and defeating mighty creatures to secure valuable relics and additional resources.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.poster.avif?t=1733505474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.webm?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/9588f9fd9bb7ebc281dd8bde2fe28381.mp4?t=1733505474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/1d3b055411d097449968d063ab45f680.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Survive and complete missions on procedurally generated maps in unique biomes.<br></li><li> Earn fame and return looted treasures to build, upgrade and customize your own home island.<br></li><li> Play solo or with up to three friends and choose your own adventure, difficulty and mission complexity.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492050/extras/2f7034d515c8457f9816c4d928a2ffbc.webp?t=1733505474\" /></div><br>Arcane Wilds offers a unique blend of fantasy and western themes across its factions:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Army: Boasting a powerful arsenal, the Army faction excels in ranged combat with essence-powered cannons, compensating for their low mobility with exceptional firepower.<br></li><li> Colony: Comprising a motley crew of gunslingers, the Colony faction employs explosive barrels and rapid-firing gatling guns, creating a versatile force on the battlefield.<br></li><li> Tribe: Known for their agility and adaptability, the Tribe faction utilizes movable structures and chaos-inducing abilities from medicine men and shamans to wreak havoc among enemies.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Arcane Wilds is a western themed fantasy RTS with a unique twist on resource management. Gather, steal, and transport resources to use them in battle strategically. Embark on a new journey, survive missions, face mystical creatures in battle and loot treasures to build and upgrade your home island.",
